the target language is: lps.

the maximum time is 14.

the actions are:
    the move move with *an index*, *a thing*, *a second index* and *a second thing* is made; known as move.

the fluents are:
    *a role* is the capture of *a thing*; known as capture.
    *an index* cell *a second index* with *a third index* with *a role*; known as cell.
    *a role* is a control; known as control.
    *a thing* is a step; known as step.
    the goal of *a role* is *a number*; known as goal.
    *a thing* is the occupiedcell of *a second thing*; known as occupiedcell.

the templates are:
    open.
    the game is terminal.
    *a thing* is legal.
    *a thing* forward *a second thing* with *a third thing* with *a fourth thing*.
    *a thing* backward *a second thing* with *a third thing* with *a fourth thing*.
    *a thing* diagonal *a second thing* with *a third thing* with *a fourth thing*.
    the next of *a thing* is *a second thing*.
    the captureadd of *a thing* is *a second thing*.
    *a thing* score *a second thing* with *a third thing*.
    *a thing* is the succ of *a second thing*.
    *a thing* is playable.

the knowledge base battleofnumbers includes:

the text of the game is at "sources/battleofnumbers.hrf".

a thing is legal if
    the thing is playable.

the game is terminal if
    it is not the case that open.

open if
    a thing is playable.

a thing forward a second thing with a third thing with a fourth thing if
    the next of the thing is the third thing
    and the next of the second thing is the fourth thing.

a thing forward a second thing with a third thing with a fourth thing if
    the next of the third thing is the thing
    and the next of the second thing is the fourth thing.

a thing backward a second thing with a third thing with a fourth thing if
    the next of the thing is the third thing
    and the next of the fourth thing is the second thing.

a thing backward a second thing with a third thing with a fourth thing if
    the next of the third thing is the thing
    and the next of the fourth thing is the second thing.

a thing diagonal a second thing with a third thing with a fourth thing if
    the thing forward the second thing with the third thing with the fourth thing.

a thing diagonal a second thing with a third thing with a fourth thing if
    the thing backward the second thing with the third thing with the fourth thing.

