the goal of red is a number at a time if
    red is the capture of a thing at the time
    and green is the capture of a second thing at the time
    and the thing score the second thing with the number.

the goal of green is a number at a time if
    red is the capture of a thing at the time
    and green is the capture of a second thing at the time
    and the second thing score the thing with the number.

a thing is the occupiedcell of a second thing at a time if
    the thing cell the second thing with an index with a role at the time.

when the move move with an index, a thing, a second index and a second thing is made
    and the index cell the thing with a third index with a role
then the second index cell the second thing with the third index with the role
    and it is not the case that the index cell the thing with the third index with the role.

when the move move with an index, a thing, a second index and a second thing is made
    and the second index cell the second thing with a third index with a role
then it is not the case that the second index cell the second thing with the third index with the role.

when the move move with an index, a thing, a second index and a second thing is made
    and a role is a control
    and the second index cell the second thing with a third index with a second role
    and the role is the capture of a third thing
    and the captureadd of the third thing is a fourth thing
then the role is the capture of the fourth thing
    and it is not the case that the role is the capture of the third thing.

when the move move with an index, a thing, a second index and a second thing is made
    and red is a control
then green is a control
    and it is not the case that red is a control.

when the move move with an index, a thing, a second index and a second thing is made
    and green is a control
then red is a control
    and it is not the case that green is a control.

when the move move with an index, a thing, a second index and a second thing is made
    and a third thing is a step
    and the third thing is the succ of a fourth thing
then the fourth thing is a step
    and it is not the case that the third thing is a step.

